{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42307","headline":"和方泰州见寄 · 徐铉","name":"和方泰州见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逐客凄凄重入京，旧愁新恨两难胜。\n云收楚塞千山雪，风结秦淮一尺冰。\n置醴筵空情岂尽，投湘文就思如凝。\n更残月落知孤坐，遥望船窗一点星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}